# Supabase Configuration (Client-side)
# Get these from your Supabase project settings: https://app.supabase.com/project/_/settings/api

#VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
#VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here

# Fastify API server base URL — REQUIRED. All API calls
# (webapp/src/api/client.ts) go through it; the Supabase edge functions
# were decommissioned 2026-07-24.
# Local dev server: http://localhost:8090
# Production: https://recordio-production.up.railway.app
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8090

# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
# STRIPE_PRICE_ID=price_...

# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

# MUX_TOKEN_ID=...
# MUX_TOKEN_SECRET=...
# MUX_WEBHOOK_SECRET=...